# --- Large, regenerable generated data ------------------------------------------
# The Phase 7 unit-cell-library checkpoint and its derived database/geometry exports
# (~554 MB total): fully regenerable via `examples/build_unit_cell_library.py`
# (resumable, appends to checkpoint.jsonl). Tests needing them skip cleanly when
# absent (tests/conftest.py's session fixture). manifest.json/reports/plots are kept
# (small, useful as committed reference).
results/unit_cell_library/_solve/
results/unit_cell_library/database/
results/unit_cell_library/geometry/

# Real HFSS Touchstone exports (~23 MB each; 3 of them ~70 MB total). Regenerable
# only by re-running HFSS itself -- NOT regenerable from this repo's own code.
# hfss_data-marked tests skip cleanly when these are absent
# (see docs/DEVELOPING.md "Regenerating or fetching excluded data").
*.s36p
*.s4p

# An ad hoc snapshot of src/ bundled alongside an HFSS delivery at some point;
# redundant with the tracked src/ tree itself.
hfss_exports/_src_snapshot.tgz

# --- Stray files not meant to be tracked ---------------------------------------
/efl.txt
